<p>You could make creatures that reproduces at a fast rate, like each worm can make 5-10 more in mere hours. That way if one were sent to a planet it would make hundreds more in a mere day. That would really be a more efficient way to take over a planet, and that would justify a massive biomass sending small amount of them through the galaxy. It could reproduce only in cold regions and eat everything in the way, to secrete a substance that make the world colder (by reflecting sunlight or whatever) and become the perfect breeding ground for more worms or something bigger the entity wants to send.</p>
